  "title": "Clear the Field",
  "notes": "# The Valley 4.19.4 - Clear the Field\n\n**Performance**\n- Troops no longer pile up outside the enemy gate. Once every town is taken, only 12 per side wait at the gate; later waves run round the other towns.\n- Boss call-ups (\"Oproep\" soldiers) are capped at 4 near a boss and fall away after 1 to 2.5 minutes. Before, they never left.\n\n**Town Portal**\n- Press Y (or the button) and the realm map opens: pick your harbour or any town in the valley. Enemy towns are marked. Every 90 s, not in combat.\n- The button now shows a portal swirl icon.\n\n**Titans**\n- Titans top out at level 300.\n\n(c) 2018-2026 Antwerp Designs | Ionity (Pty) Ltd | AEDI | Policy 986 AED\n",
  "released": "2026-10-30T19:57:47Z",
